"application/x-tex">\displaystyle\tilde{T}_{5}:={\bm{\beta}}_{*}^{\top}{\bm{h}}^{\top}{\bm{h}}{\bm{\beta}}_{*}-\mathbb{E}\left[{\bm{\beta}}_{*}^{\top}{\bm{h}}^{\top}{\bm{h}}{\bm{\beta}}_{*}\right]=\left({\bm{u}}_{\beta}{\bm{\Sigma}}^{\dagger\top}{\bm{a}}\right)^{2}-\mu_{\tilde{T}_{5}}({\bm{a}}^{\top}{\bm{a}})({\bm{u}}_{\beta}^{\top}{\bm{u}}_{\beta})</annotation></semantics></math></p>
</div></li>
