<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A4.Ex336.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=({\bm{\beta}}_{*}^{\top}{\bm{u}})^{2}\mathbb{E}\left[\frac{\eta^{4}}{\gamma_{1}^{2}}\right]\left(\mathbb{E}\left[\|{\bm{t}}\|^{2}\right]\right)^{2}\mathbb{E}\left[{\bm{k}}^{\top}{\bm{A}}^{\dagger}{\bm{A}}^{\dagger\top}{\bm{k}}\right]+\sqrt{\mathrm{Var}\left(\frac{\eta^{4}}{\gamma_{1}^{2}}\right)O\left(\frac{1}{n}\right)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝜷</mi><mo>∗</mo><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝒖</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>η</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝒕</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝒌</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝑨</mi><mo>†</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝑨</mi><mrow><mo>†</mo><mo lspace="0em">⁣</mo><mo>⊤</mo></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝒌</mi></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mrow><mrow><mi>Var</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>η</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>O</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=({\bm{\beta}}_{*}^{\top}{\bm{u}})^{2}\mathbb{E}\left[\frac{\eta^{4}}{\gamma_{1}^{2}}\right]\left(\mathbb{E}\left[\|{\bm{t}}\|^{2}\right]\right)^{2}\mathbb{E}\left[{\bm{k}}^{\top}{\bm{A}}^{\dagger}{\bm{A}}^{\dagger\top}{\bm{k}}\right]+\sqrt{\mathrm{Var}\left(\frac{\eta^{4}}{\gamma_{1}^{2}}\right)O\left(\frac{1}{n}\right)}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
