<p id="A4.SS5.SSS6.p12.3" class="ltx_p">Using the squared norms from Lemmas <a href="#Thmlemma6" title="Lemma 6 (Squared Norms of 𝒑_1 and 𝒑_2). ‣ D.3.5 Helper Lemmas ‣ D.3 Step 2: Simplifying Terms ‣ Appendix D Proof of Theorem ‣ Risk Phase Transitions in Spiked Regression: Alignment Driven Benign and Catastrophic Overfitting" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>, <a href="#Thmlemma7" title="Lemma 7 (Squared Norms of 𝒒_1 and 𝒒_2). ‣ D.3.5 Helper Lemmas ‣ D.3 Step 2: Simplifying Terms ‣ Appendix D Proof of Theorem ‣ Risk Phase Transitions in Spiked Regression: Alignment Driven Benign and Catastrophic Overfitting" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>,</p>
