<p id="A4.SS5.SSS6.p12.5" class="ltx_p">For the term <math id="A4.SS5.SSS6.p12.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{k}}^{\top}{\bm{A}}^{\dagger}{\bm{h}}^{\top}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>𝒌</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝑨</mi><mo>†</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝒉</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{k}}^{\top}{\bm{A}}^{\dagger}{\bm{h}}^{\top}</annotation></semantics></math>,</p>
